# The determinism twin: byte-identical play to evolve3-g3m10 under a
# different name. evolve5's finale named a member with EXACTLY the
# base's compiled goals as +614 over the base on 8 shared seeds --
# which is a reading of the harness's same-doctrine noise floor, not
# of any doctrine. This file exists to measure that floor on purpose.
# The survival search's graduate ([[impossible-economy-problem]] win path,
# Phase A): evolve3 (rng 7, imp-survival regime, fitness = samples stood)
# generation 3 member 10, best of the run at +1,310 samples over the
# flame-nocover base across 8 pairs. The composition the elite converged
# on: two heavyTanks in place of the base's third c_tank and its
# hoverTank -- double heavy armor, hover eliminated. Generation fitness
# is selection-biased and adopts nothing; the fresh-seed survival panel
# is the verdict tier.
name det-twin
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,heavyTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
guard_cap 0
raid 3
tech 1
